AWS Lambda Image Processing & CloudWatch Monitoring

Overview

A serverless image-processing application built with AWS Lambda, Amazon S3, CloudWatch, SNS, and Terraform.

Images uploaded to S3 trigger a Lambda function that processes the image and stores the output in another S3 bucket. CloudWatch monitors the Lambda using both AWS built-in metrics and application-specific custom metrics, with alarms sending notifications through SNS.

